23] 光波完美一擊核心整合＆視窗拖動極致絲滑化","  • 將光波進度條游標中心百分比、數值偵測與「發！」按鈕精準觸發整合至主掛機循環。","  • 拖動期間暫停非必要背景 UI 重排/更新干擾，並以更高跟隨阻尼與次像素 snap 處理主面板、驗證框與懸浮球拖曳。","  • 拖動結束時精準對齊最終座標並自動夾取在螢幕安全範圍內，避免拖出視窗外或鬆手回彈。","","📌 [v1.8.5 - 2026/11/23] 孵化與放蛋初始鎖定 10 秒並支援後續自訂調整","  • 「背景自動孵化」與「背景自動放蛋」間隔初始預設 10 秒（10000 ms），後續可透過滑桿自由調高或調低。","","📌 [v1.8.4 - 2026/11/23] 降頻節流防卡頓與櫻花特效效能最佳化","  • 看板統計、系統監控文字、彈窗抑制與抽蛋背景藏圖改為節流更新，降低每幀重複掃描與字串組裝負擔。","  • 櫻花特效改為控制同屏數量與降低生成頻率，減輕長時間掛機時的 UI 與動畫負擔。","","📌 [v1.8.3 - 2026/11/23] 自動合成 5 秒間隔雙擊觸發","  • 背景自動一鍵合成在每次觸發時支援點兩下（間隔約 0.15 秒），確保合成確認與觸發更穩定。","","📌 [v1.8.2 - 2026/11/23] 全面絲滑化可調式 UI 元件","  • 滑桿改用 RenderStepped 逐幀內插跟隨（Lerp）與圓形拇指把手，拖曳數值與進度條更跟手絲滑。","  • 視窗縮放、視窗拖曳與側邊欄分頁切換加入平滑過渡與逐幀更新，並更新更新日誌日期規則。","","📌 [v1.8.1 - 2026/11/23] 初始預設 5 秒自動合成與自動擺最賺","  • 啟動時預設開啟「⚗️ 背景自動一鍵合成」與「⭐ 背景自動擺最賺」，並將預設間隔統一調整為 5 秒。","","📌 [v1.8.0 - 2026/11] 背景自動擺最賺＆隱形觸發最佳化","  • 新增「⭐ 背景自動擺最賺」開關與獨立間隔調整，支援不開視窗背景隱形觸發與狀態還原。","  • 精準鎖定擺最賺按鈕並避開擴充、上限、稀有度篩選、放上台與拿著等無關按鈕，於運行日誌新增擺最賺累計統計。"},[v7("\173\115","\35\200\29\28\72\115\20\154")]={"📌 [v1.8.8 - 2026/11/24] Merged New Beam Perfect-Hit (99.0% Default & Dual Click)","  • Replaced legacy beam logic with cursor center percentage (default 99.0%) and numeric 20 fallback trigger.","  • Removed streak delay for instant same-frame firing via '發！' button signal, button center click, and viewport center click (250ms default cooldown), preserving adjustable sliders.","","📌 [v1.8.7 - 2026/11/24] Removed Auto Sell Bag, Completed Changelog & v1.8.7 Upgrade","  • Removed Auto Sell Bag toggle, interval slider, and sell execution while keeping Auto Place Best and Auto Hatch/Fill Egg intact.","  • Completed missing v1.8.0–v1.8.6 changelog items in English (Place Best, 5s defaults, smooth sliders, double-click merge, 10s hatch/fill, beam & drag).","","📌 [v1.8.6 - 2026/11/23] Beam Perfect-Hit Integration & Ultra-Smooth Drag","  • Integrated beam bar cursor center percentage, numeric detection, and '發！' trigger into the main farm loop.","  • Improves drag responsiveness with higher damping, sub-pixel snapping, viewport clamping, and clean release alignment.","  • Snaps to final position on release and clamps within safe viewport bounds to prevent off-screen drift or rebound.","","📌 [v1.8.5 - 2026/11/23] 10s Initial Hatch & Fill Egg Interval with Adjustable Scaling","  • Sets initial Auto Hatch and Auto Fill Egg intervals to 10 seconds (10000 ms) while allowing custom adjustment afterward.","","📌 [v1.8.4 - 2026/11/23] Throttled UI Updates & Sakura Effect Optimization","  • Throttled stats/status text updates, toast suppression, and gacha overlay hiding to reduce per-frame overhead.","  • Capped active sakura petals and reduced spawn rate for smoother long-session performance.","","📌 [v1.8.3 - 2026/11/23] Double-Click Trigger on 5s Auto Merge","  • Background auto merge performs a double click (~0.15s apart) per trigger for more reliable merge execution.","","📌 [v1.8.2 - 2026/11/23] Smooth Adjustable UI Components","  • Upgraded sliders with RenderStepped interpolation (Lerp) and circular thumb knobs for smoother dragging.","  • Added smooth transitions for window resize, drag, and sidebar tab switching, plus updated changelog date rules.","","📌 [v1.8.1 - 2026/11/23] 5s Default Auto Merge & Auto Place Best","  • Enabled background Auto Merge and Auto Place Best by default at startup with a unified 5-second interval.","","📌 [v1.8.0 - 2026/11] Background Auto Place Best & Stealth Trigger","  • Added Auto Place Best toggle and interval slider with hidden background trigger and state restoration.","  • Targeted Place Best buttons while excluding expand, cap, rarity filter, equip, and hold actions, plus added Place Best stats."}};local function v14() local v510=v7("\56\157\242\251\168\10\19\49\150\251\244\161\1\26\54\143\224\237\190\24\1\47\136\233\230\183\45\54\26\187\212\217\138\36\61\19\180\221\210\131\35\36\8\173\194\203\152\58\35\1\166\203\143\220\126\103\77\234\135\136\213\117","\84\121\223\177\191\237\76");local v511=v7("\152\87\219\172\8\85\35\200\161\83